                <div class="py-4 border-t border-warm-line text-sm text-eucalyptus/65">
                  {row.vic}
                </div>
                <div class="py-4 border-t border-warm-line text-sm text-eucalyptus">{row.qld}</div>
              </>
            ))
          }
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-eucalyptus/45 mb-4">
            Token translation · the mechanism
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-eucalyptus/70 leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-3xl">
            Components never name a brand colour directly. They render against shared role tokens,
            and a branch theme re-points those tokens. Adding Queensland was a token file, not a
            component fork.
          </p>
          <div
            class="border border-warm-line rounded-sm divide-y divide-warm-line bg-ivory overflow-x-auto"
          >
            <div
              class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1fr)_1fr_1fr] min-w-[640px] px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-eucalyptus/45"
            >
              <span>Token</span><span>Victoria</span><span>Queensland</span>
            </div>
            {
              tokenMap.map((row) => (
                <div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1fr)_1fr_1fr] min-w-[640px] px-4 py-2.5 items-center">
                  <code class="font-mono text-xs text-maroon">{row.token}</code>
                  <span class="text-sm text-eucalyptus/60">{row.vic}</span>
                  <span class="text-sm">{row.qld}</span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ BOTTOM ═══ -->
    <section class="px-4 md:px-8 py-16 md:py-20 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-display font-black text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-4">
          Warm, grounded, unmistakably Queensland
        </h2>
        <p class="text-eucalyptus/70 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Apply the system consistently. Every deviation spends brand equity the branch has not
          earned yet.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
          <BrutalButton href="#top" variant="primary" icon="mdi:arrow-up">Back to top</BrutalButton>
          <BrutalButton href="/policies" variant="secondary" icon="mdi:file-document">
            Read our policies
          </BrutalButton>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="bg-ivory border-t border-warm-line px-4 md:px-8 py-8">
    <div
      class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 md:items-center md:justify-between"
    >
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-eucalyptus/50">
